# Brainfuck owned compact AArch64 streaming instruction bytes
# The transport sends marker one and raw byte per record
# A zero marker closes input
# Output is tag one length byte and exact native instruction bytes
# Trailing NOOP padding is not included
# Brackets are rejected until dynamic relocation is connected
# Final two bytes are zero terminator and error status
